/*******************************************************************************
 *
 * FUNCTION:    acpi_ut_copy_eobject_to_iobject
 *
 * PARAMETERS:  *internal_object   - The external object to be converted
 *              *buffer_ptr     - Where the internal object is returned
 *
 * RETURN:      Status          - the status of the call
